    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800701/2018007010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "冬優子の母",
    "text": "あら～、もしかして、ふゆちゃん照れてる……？\r\nでもダメよー、お母さんもっと聞きたいもの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "冬優子の母",
    "text": "ふゆちゃん、\r\nおうちでこういうお話、あんまりしてくれないし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018007010030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "プロデューサーが話しに来てくれるんだから\r\nふゆから言う必要ないでしょっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800701/2018007010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018007010040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ほらもうっ、報告は終わったんだから！\r\n今日はこれでおしまいっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800701/2018007010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "冬優子の母",
    "text": "え～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018007010050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "いいわよねっ、プロデューサー！",
